{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"hechang-e-9d7e3887c7558e614f15","title":"孙盛论俭节选人支持和洽","accounts":[{"id":"hechang-a-9d7e3887c7558e614f15","label":"裴注·孙盛评论","text":"孙盛论俭节选人支持和洽","evidence":["hechang-q-d3a8dcb6753162068024"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hechang-q-d3a8dcb6753162068024"]},"ordering_evidence":"hechang-q-d3a8dcb6753162068024","related_events":[{"event":"hechang-e-d739d48ce3a4a40543d0","type":"related","evidence":["hechang-q-d3a8dcb6753162068024","hechang-q-77db8167ab87e71e7e3f"]}],"order":4666},{"id":"hechang-e-d739d48ce3a4a40543d0","title":"和洽议选人不宜专尚俭节","accounts":[{"id":"hechang-a-d739d48ce3a4a40543d0","label":"正文","text":"和洽议选人不宜专尚俭节","evidence":["hechang-q-77db8167ab87e71e7e3f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0325","role":"进言","evidence":["hechang-q-77db8167ab87e71e7e3f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hechang-q-77db8167ab87e71e7e3f"]},"ordering_evidence":"hechang-q-77db8167ab87e71e7e3f","related_events":[{"event":"hechang-e-9d7e3887c7558e614f15","type":"related","evidence":["hechang-q-d3a8dcb6753162068024","hechang-q-77db8167ab87e71e7e3f"]}],"order":4662}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"hechang-q-77db8167ab87e71e7e3f","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-17b65cb0b114084098b9","layer":"original","quote":"太祖定荆州，辟为丞相掾、属。时毛玠、崔琰并以忠清干事，其选用先尚俭节〖1〗。洽言曰：“天下大器，在位与人，不可以一节（俭）〔检〕也。俭素过中〖2〗，自以处身则可；以此节格物〖3〗，所失或多。今朝廷之议，吏有著新衣、乘好车者，谓之不清〖4〗；长吏过营〖5〗，形容不饰，衣裘敝坏者，谓之廉洁。至令士大夫故污辱其衣〖6〗，藏其舆服；朝府大吏〖7〗，或自挈壶餐以入官寺〖8〗。夫立教观俗，贵处中庸〖9〗：为可继也〖10〗。今崇一概难堪之行以检殊途〖11〗，勉而为之，必有疲瘁。古之大教，务在通人情而已；凡激诡之行〖12〗，则容隐伪矣。”﹝一﹞。","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":14,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":268,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-d3a8dcb6753162068024","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-8859a6b609f47052c4b1","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞孙盛曰：“昔先王御世，观民设教；虽质文因时，损益代用，至于车服礼秩，贵贱等差，其归一揆。魏承汉乱，风俗侈泰；诚宜仰思古制，训以约简；使奢不陵肆，俭足中礼；进无蜉蝣之刺，退免采莫之讥。如此，则治道隆而颂声作矣。夫矫枉过正则巧伪滋生，以克训下则民志险隘；非圣王所以陶化民物，闲邪存诚之道。和洽之言，于是允矣。”","attribution":"裴注·孙盛评论","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":55,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c125063ebfed9af3d9ee","start":0,"end":156,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
